      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought this was a requirement during the design discussion, but don\u0027t see it any more.\n\nChecking this guarantees that the RO_GSCVD location is in the validated RO space, I can drop this if you think this is not necessary, in fact checking that FPAP is covered by the signature increases the code size and makes it less clear.",
