      "writtenOn": "2021-09-28T20:55:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think keeping functions small makes the code easier to follow, I renamed the function into read_gscvd_header() to make its purpose clearer.",
      "parentUuid": "54940ce8_35eaaec1",
      "revId": "e272a15aab408f1d370ed0383f3db203106dabe0",
